                    <p class="text-base leading-loose" style="color:#4A3F31">{t("大学受験、成績、進路、将来への不安。さらに、友人関係や恋愛、SNSでの比較など、自分自身や周囲との関係に心が揺れやすい時期でもあります。「自分は何をしたいのか」——人生について深く考え始める時期だからこそ、心身へのプレッシャーも大きくなります。", "University entrance exams, grades, career paths, and uncertainty about the future. Friendships, romance, and comparisons on social media can also make this a time of emotional uncertainty about oneself and others. As students begin asking what they want from life, the pressure on mind and body can grow.")}</p>
