                      <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:#4A3F31"><span aria-hidden="true" style="color:var(--color-soft-terracotta);flex:none">✦</span><span>{t("大学受験前の心身コンディショニング", "Mind-body conditioning before university entrance exams")}</span></li>
                      <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:#4A3F31"><span aria-hidden="true" style="color:var(--color-soft-terracotta);flex:none">✦</span><span>{t("受験・進路に向き合うためのストレスマネジメント", "Stress management for exams and future decisions")}</span></li>
