                      <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:#4A3F31"><span aria-hidden="true" style="color:var(--color-soft-terracotta);flex:none">✦</span><span>{t("部活動・アスリート向けハタヨガ", "Hatha Yoga for sports clubs and athletes")}</span></li>
